Z||000000||Spektrum-87GT||09-12-2001||11:00 PM||||ok.. not only am i plannin on doing the 3.4, but to further complicate things, i plan on adding a 100hp shot of nos. Ive heard that the 3.4 swap has problem with fuel delivery when using old fiero parts. does anyone have a good recommendation of where i should look for aftermarket parts? or would it be better to replace the stock system completely? thanks||||reg||1
Z||000001||Alex4mula||09-13-2001||08:36 AM||||Which 3.4 you are talking about? DOHC or pushrods? For the later I don't know where have you heard that. If you are going to use NOS then the comment can apply to any car. Your fuel system needs to be up to date or you may want to improve it with better flowing pump, injectors and ignition. Still with only a 100HP shot you shouldn't have any problem with a good stock system. Many here run those systems. Search NOS in the archives.||||reg||1
